 "description": "Get NBRB FX rates in BYN per 1 USD/EUR/RUB. No dates = latest; date = one day; date_from/date_to = range; group_by + both bounds = weekly/monthly averages. Example: {\"currency\":\"usd\",\"date\":\"2026-06-18\"}.",
